# Docgrity — local development. Copy to .env if needed. NEVER commit .env.
#
# The Forge app does NOT read this file: provider, model and API key are
# configured in-app (Confluence → Apps → Docgrity → Settings) and stored as
# Forge KVS secrets. This file exists only for optional local tooling.

# Optional: test scans without cloud quota using local Ollama + forge tunnel.
# Requires: `ollama serve` running and models pulled, e.g.
#   ollama pull llama3.1:8b && ollama pull nomic-embed-text
# Then run `cd apps/forge && forge tunnel` and pick "Ollama" in Settings.
# (URL is fixed to http://localhost:11434 — nothing to configure here.)
